    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/ceac4bd9950210a99ad0b14906d7c9b5.avif?t=1754668171\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/a114e9b7d5df51e4412fbfda96f1557f.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/a114e9b7d5df51e4412fbfda96f1557f.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/a114e9b7d5df51e4412fbfda96f1557f.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only False will be hitting the shelves in Early Access with (for now) two different game modes: Rotten Deck, for those who thrive on a whirlwind of lies, and Rock Paper Scissors: Minus One, which strategy enthusiasts will love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Early Access continues, we plan to add two more modes: a simplified poker variant and a surprise card game that up to 8 people can play at once. We\u2019re keeping further details about that second mode under wraps for now! =)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/d91b4e85c7c13dc5405733f930b91f65.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/d91b4e85c7c13dc5405733f930b91f65.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/d91b4e85c7c13dc5405733f930b91f65.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/ff3e59737254b85c67967e3a23318711.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/ff3e59737254b85c67967e3a23318711.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/ff3e59737254b85c67967e3a23318711.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Played with a standard deck of playing cards, this bluff-based mode has players fighting for survival through a penalty we call \u201cChinese Roulette,\u201d rather than the typical Russian Roulette. In Russian Roulette, getting hit by the bullet is all about chance, but in Chinese Roulette, you pay the price of your own decisions. =)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal of the Game:</strong> Get rid of all the cards in your hand before you die and be the last one standing \u2014 yes, it\u2019s a bit challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported Number of Players:</strong> 2\u20134</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the round, the table card is determined randomly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players choose a card from their hand, place it face down on the table, and bluff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next player can choose to check the authenticity of the cards placed on the table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a player is caught bluffing or falsely accuses someone of bluffing, they must choose one of the triggers that activates a deadly trap, and this choice will determine their fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the chosen trigger activates a trap, the player who made the selection dies, and the other players continue the game. If the trap is not triggered, the game continues with the same players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/81c00b292865448b184cbb197e4a9a12.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/81c00b292865448b184cbb197e4a9a12.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/81c00b292865448b184cbb197e4a9a12.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/e7c2d277079b0c92be09bfd2cc777a5e.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/e7c2d277079b0c92be09bfd2cc777a5e.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name says it all. For those who haven\u2019t heard of it, think of it as a two-handed twist on Rock-Paper-Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal of the Game:</strong> Stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported Number of Players:</strong> 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each round, each player declares which sign they want to use for each hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players present their hands simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After one second, each player pulls back one of their hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loser faces the thrill of Russian Roulette by courtesy of the owner of the \u201cMouse Bar.\u201d The game continues until one player dies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/dd6e1429d346b18be80cd935df25e5c9.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/dd6e1429d346b18be80cd935df25e5c9.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/dd6e1429d346b18be80cd935df25e5c9.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique story and attitude, bringing a different energy to the table every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lennie:</strong> Forget everything you know(!) To handle Lennie, you\u2019ve got to be on his level\u2014mentally, that is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mrs. Pearl:</strong> Impressive, charming, and sweet as honey. Sitting at the same table with her is truly an honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slick Rick:</strong> Don\u2019t ask him about his shady past, especially how he got that nickname\u2026 Slick Rick is a slippery master of lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hank the Mush:</strong> If you spot this shady mushroom in dark, damp corners, hold your breath and go the other way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/b7e99bfaea12103e02a280c5f6046687.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/b7e99bfaea12103e02a280c5f6046687.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/b7e99bfaea12103e02a280c5f6046687.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We can\u2019t protect against your bluffs or your best \u201cpoker face,\u201d but for everything else, we rely on Easy Anti Cheat. You won\u2019t see bizarre things here like elongated necks or self-flying chairs (OooOOOoO). If you do spot something like that, don\u2019t hesitate to report it! We promise to remove any disruptive players from the game as soon as possible.<br><br><strong>Regular Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BY THE POWER OF EARLY ACCESS! Two multiplayer game modes are already part of our roadmap. In addition, throughout Early Access, we\u2019ll be gathering your requests via Discord, the Steam Community Page, and even Whatsapp (! Bluff) to add different modes, new characters, and character skins to the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/a114e9b7d5df51e4412fbfda96f1557f.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/a114e9b7d5df51e4412fbfda96f1557f.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/a114e9b7d5df51e4412fbfda96f1557f.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only False will be hitting the shelves in Early Access with (for now) two different game modes: Rotten Deck, for those who thrive on a whirlwind of lies, and Rock Paper Scissors: Minus One, which strategy enthusiasts will love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Early Access continues, we plan to add two more modes: a simplified poker variant and a surprise card game that up to 8 people can play at once. We\u2019re keeping further details about that second mode under wraps for now! =)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/d91b4e85c7c13dc5405733f930b91f65.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/d91b4e85c7c13dc5405733f930b91f65.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/d91b4e85c7c13dc5405733f930b91f65.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat