game. If the trap is not triggered, the game continues with the same players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/81c00b292865448b184cbb197e4a9a12.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/81c00b292865448b184cbb197e4a9a12.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/81c00b292865448b184cbb197e4a9a12.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/e7c2d277079b0c92be09bfd2cc777a5e.poster.avif?t=1754668171\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/e7c2d277079b0c92be09bfd2cc777a5e.webm?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name says it all. For those who haven\u2019t heard of it, think of it as a two-handed twist on Rock-Paper-Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal of the Game:</strong> Stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supported Number of Players:</strong> 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each round, each player declares which sign they want to use for each hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players present their hands simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After one second, each player pulls back one of their hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loser faces the thrill of Russian Roulette by courtesy o