akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371930/extras/b7e99bfaea12103e02a280c5f6046687.mp4?t=1754668171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We can\u2019t protect against your bluffs or your best \u201cpoker face,\u201d but for everything else, we rely on Easy Anti Cheat. You won\u2019t see bizarre things here like elongated necks or self-flying chairs (OooOOOoO). If you do spot something like that, don\u2019t hesitate to report it! We promise to remove any disruptive players from the game as soon as possible.<br><br><strong>Regular Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BY THE POWER OF EARLY ACCESS! Two multiplayer game modes are already part of our roadmap. In addition, throughout Early Access, we\u2019ll be gathering your requests via Discord, the Steam Community Page, and even Whatsapp (! Bluff) to add different modes, new characters, and character skins to the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Only False is a party game that blends bluffing and strategy, spiced up with a dash of dark humor. In Only False, a game for those who can\u2019t get enough lies, you\u2019ll sometimes lie like a politician, and sometimes think as strategically as Sun Tzu.",
